WEBVTT

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.610
You shouldn't be living in such an environment! You should leave your master!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.050
"The Truth About Wolves"

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.550
Oh, it's already undone.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.890
This part must be the Lost Precious.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.330
Master, what are you going to do with him?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.780
I suppose I'll keep him in the basement for a while.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.770
He's a level 10 breaker.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:28.510
There's a good chance he has an A Class Lost Precious.

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.040
When he wakes up, I'll ask him about it.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:39.570
Don't worry. Have I ever hurt anyone for no reason?

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.120
No.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:58.520
Master, I'm sorry for being captured.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.670
Do you have that woman's Lost Precious?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.280
Yes. It's right here.

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:07.580
You accomplished your mission.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.480
It was my fault for sending you in such a hurry.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.560
In any case, I'm glad you're all right.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.560
Master.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.370
Put the Lost Precious in this box.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.100
I'll rest a little before examining it.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.030
Okay.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.040
It's beautiful.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.810
You must be tired.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.250
Drink this.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.190
Okay.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:29.420
Master, what kind of power do those earrings have?

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.420
I don't know the details.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.220
What's wrong?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.600
Nothing.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.550
The Nanao Family has been searching for it.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.450
It must be valuable.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.010
The earrings hear the voice of truth.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.430
They allow one to read a person's thoughts.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.460
What is it?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:59.680
It's nothing. My arm hurts from being bound.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.990
Even you don't know the power of the earrings?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.420
That's what I said.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.340
They allow one to hear what a person is really thinking.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.580
What's wrong, Ai? Does it hurt that much?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:18.360
Something's wrong with her. Am I not being affectionate enough?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.320
Sorry for putting you in danger.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.360
Are you hungry? Let's have something to eat soon.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.970
I'll feed you, so cheer up.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:36.110
I'm sorry. I'm not feeling well.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.850
I'm going to rest in my room.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.120
I see.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.820
I'll take this to the laboratory.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.800
Wait.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.400
Leave the box.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.970
Surely you didn't...

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:57.030
Master, you took me in, didn't you?

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:01.630
You raised me to be your partner to do good, didn't you?

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.010
That's right.

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.290
I kidnapped you 15 years ago.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:09.220
You're a dog I've been using for my experiments.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:23.700
I told you not to touch Lost Preciouses.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:31.450
Ai!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.580
Their irises match. Saeki and Furumori are the same person.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.740
That bastard!

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:43.810
Ryuji.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.620
I'll send the keepers.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:50.790
Furumori's existence is a secret, so it may take some time.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.030
Don't do anything dangerous.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.790
But you're not listening to me, are you?

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.280
Of course not!

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.280
I'll save Ryuji.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.910
Understood.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:08.010
One more thing. The hair collected from Odd Eye at the party...

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.930
Where am I?

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.700
The rope came off.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:24.970
Are you okay?

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.120
Yes.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.590
Good.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.130
"Good"?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.510
I'm the one who kidnapped you and trapped you here!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:34.030
And all you have to say is "good"?

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:35.730
Well, I...

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.350
Your hands and arms are swollen.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.670
Shut up!

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:46.430
It's okay. I won't hurt you.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.490
Sorry.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.580
I was just worried about your injuries.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.390
Sorry for trying to touch you without permission.

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:06.530
Why won't they ring?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.190
What's wrong?

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:18.200
My master has been lying to me.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.680
He's always been lying to me.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:21.600
Lying?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.420
About everything.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.470
You were right.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:32.670
I have nothing left. Nowhere to call home. No one to rely on.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.750
Then why don't you stay with me?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.910
If you don't have anywhere to go, stay with me.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:45.790
Eriko-san and Rose will be there. They're a little noisy, but they're good people.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.580
If you want to, that is.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:54.310
What are you talking about? I'm your enemy.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.390
I don't really have a reason...

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:00.590
What do you want? Why are you telling me this?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.700
What do I want?

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:07.880
She's really cute, and she's a nice girl. I want to protect her.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.760
I want to take care of her.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:12.120
You think I'm cute?

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.390
Those earrings! Are they...

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.820
Let's leave before my master comes!

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.200
Okay.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.240
I'll take you somewhere you'll be able to find a ride. After that, you're on your own.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.660
Come with me. If he finds out you let me escape, you'll...

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.010
I'll have to punish you.

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:50.770
You disobeyed your master. What a bad dog.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.510
Such dogs must be dealt with.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.950
Are you talking about her?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.560
Who else would I be referring to?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.300
I understand completely.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.730
I can't leave her here. I'm taking her with me.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.550
Don't touch my dog!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.580
A breaker.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.650
But where's your Lost Precious?

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.500
He's just like me.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.540
That's right. They're the same as your marks.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:37.890
Both my powers and yours come from here.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:41.740
There's no point in lying any more, Ai.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:47.540
There's no wolf's blood in you. You're an ordinary human.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.810
A human?

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:56.060
Yes. Her powers are acquired.

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.880
Take a look at this.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.870
This pattern is just like Ai's.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:05.040
Just as I thought, Furumori embedded a Lost Precious inside his own body.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.440
These marks appeared as a result.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.440
Then there must be one inside Ai as well.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:14.420
It's most likely a Lost Precious he stole when he escaped...

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.300
the Wolf's Fang.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.520
I was human?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.090
No...

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:25.240
You should be able to tell if I'm lying.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.650
Why would you do such a terrible thing?

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.190
It was an order from your society.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:39.200
Reducing casting time, increasing portability...

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.570
and above all else, increasing maximum potential.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:46.680
The best way to do these was to make the breaker and Lost Precious one.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:51.440
I arrived at this conclusion trying to fulfill their demands.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.400
Ai and I are the only successful subjects.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:12:03.470
Without at least an A Class Lost Precious and a level 8 breaker, it was pointless.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:06.710
Pointless? What do you think a human life is worth?

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:14.530
I have become one with five Lost Preciouses. Here's the question.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:20.670
What sort of creature will be born if I become one with Ai?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.900
Get up!

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.530
He's crazy. Why is he doing this?

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:32.600
For revenge.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:39.920
Early in his research, a woman he was working with died after being possessed by a Cursed Precious.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:47.740
A certain collector refused to lend him the Lost Precious he needed to release her.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:53.450
There are records of the repeated requests Furumori made to the higher ups of the society.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:13:01.260
After her death, Furumori began criticizing the higher ups.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:05.320
He also began acting strangely.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.330
Hang in there!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.350
We've got to run!

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:29.120
Do you have your answer, Ryuji-kun?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:34.430
What will I become if I absorb Ai? What is your answer?

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:35.960
I don't know!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.490
That's right!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.320
Nobody knows. Not even me.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.200
That's why I want to know.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:46.070
It's truly fascinating!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:52.600
You're welcome to destroy yourself, but you have no right to ruin the lives of others!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:58.520
Ryuji-kun, there's nothing I cannot do.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:05.880
The collector and the members of the society who let my friend die are living comfortably.

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:11.280
They keep the gifts of the Lost Preciouses to themselves. They are no different from me.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:18.600
What can a member of that society like you do to convince me?

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.840
Ai, you have to run!

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:22.380
Hurry!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.150
Ryuji!

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:38.590
It's okay. I'm here for you.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:43.370
I'm scared, but I need to protect her.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:49.650
You're finished, Ryuji-kun. What will you do?

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.590
I will defeat you.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:57.150
I use my powers to protect the ones I love.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.010
I use them to save those who need help.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:05.650
I won't run from the small mistakes before me because of the huge mistakes in the past.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.620
If I see anyone suffering, I will save them.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.250
That is the kind of breaker I will be.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.080
The breaker I want to be!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:20.400
Ryuji!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.470
A dragon!

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:22.850
Ryuji!

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:26.010
Erika wanted you to have this.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:29.220
A dragon? What is going on?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.540
Rose, stand back.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:36.750
Ryuji!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.640
You bitch.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:43.820
Ai!

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:44.860
Are you...

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.670
It's stone.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.700
Rose!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:53.680
Ryuji!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.390
Engage.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:31.460
I see. That dragon girl increases your power.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:34.160
Then how's this?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.420
What's this?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.620
Ryuji!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:46.990
Rot! Rot into nothing! Return to the darkness!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.180
Ryuji!

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:51.450
Ryuji!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.130
Ryuji!

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.240
Damn it!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.480
Ai, return to me.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.270
You belong to me.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.910
Hold on! I'll save you!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:07.070
How dare you!

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:13.530
Ryuji!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.590
Master!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:27.420
Master, hang in there!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.620
What is this?

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.240
Rose?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.690
I don't know.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:39.930
I just wanted to destroy that power.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:42.330
It's not good.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.010
Rose, you can do that?

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:49.000
I just wanted to protect you.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.490
I'm glad you're okay.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.100
Thanks, Rose.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.560
Master.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.250
It's gone.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.040
Master!

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:10.410
Why are you crying? I deceived you.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.380
You should kill me.

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:18.170
People from the society will be here soon.

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:21.200
Please atone for your sins for Ai's sake.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.470
You'll pay if you don't.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.280
I refuse.

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:28.860
I don't think what I did was wrong.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:32.190
I owe the society nothing.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.280
Why you...

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.210
Ryuji-kun.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.250
Lost Preciouses are full of human will.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:42.330
Have you ever considered the emotions behind that will?

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:46.570
Unable to go to heaven or hell, how would you feel...

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:51.230
if you were used by humans and confined to a dark space?

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.930
I don't want that. I refuse.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:57.260
That's what all the Lost Preciouses I gathered told me, too.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.960
I'll use my fifth Lost Precious.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:07.670
I will become mist and disappear into the atmosphere.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:11.340
I'm sure the idiots of the society will be disappointed.

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:16.300
Why don't you see how far your nice words will get you?

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.800
Master!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.650
Master, tell me.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.920
How did you feel about me?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.430
I never loved you.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.460
You were only a pet.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.630
I understand.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.600
Well?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:50.820
It's no use. He destroyed all his data.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:59.950
What do you want to do about that? Rose can erase it with her fire.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.760
I'll leave this the way it is.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:04.760
I see.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:07.360
What are you going to do now?

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:11.610
I don't have anything. Not even a family.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.840
Excuse me.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.160
Do you have a minute?

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:25.040
None of this is related to his research, but there's an entry here from 15 years ago about Makihara...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.500
Makihara...

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:33.500
Makihara-san! His child was stolen along with his Lost Preciouses 15 years ago!

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.170
It's possible.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:41.140
Furumori... No, Saeki called you Ai, didn't he?

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:42.020
Yes.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:48.230
It seems Makihara-san's daughter was named Aika.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:52.520
I have a family.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:57.930
Makihara-san said he'd like to see you as soon as possible.

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:00.540
We'll give you a ride if you need one.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:01.990
Thank you.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:03.410
It was nothing.

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:06.820
I'll visit you.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:12.780
I promise I'll visit.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.570
Sure. You're welcome any time.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.420
See you later.

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:21.230
Okay.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:31.630
Eriko-san, I'm going to register with the society as a level 10 breaker.

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:35.400
Are you sure? I thought you didn't want to draw attention to yourself.

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:39.770
Yes, but if I can use my powers for good...

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:45.300
Besides, I want to know more about Lost Preciouses and this world.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:48.270
All right. I'll help you apply.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:50.990
Let's go home, Ryuji.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.460
Yeah. Let's go home.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:39.960
Next episode "The Dangerous Test"

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:33.210
Tokura here. The other day, I told my finacee's parents I'm a dragon researcher...

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:38.800
they told me to find a real job. The life of a researcher is a hard one!
